# Two environments, two files, both ignored by git:
#
#   .env.local        the local Supabase stack  ->  make dev-local
#   .env.cloud.local  the deployed database     ->  make dev
#
# Copy this file to whichever you need. Vite loads `.env.cloud.local` only in
# cloud mode, where it outranks `.env.local`, so the two never mix.
#
# Local values come from `make db-status`; deployed ones from the Supabase
# project's API settings.
#
# Only publishable/anon keys belong in either. A Supabase secret or
# service-role key in a VITE_ variable would be bundled into the JavaScript
# served to every visitor — never put one in these files.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
VITE_APP_NAME=Roco Summer League
